Let prices be coffee beans $12.50, mug $8, filter papers $3.20.

Keep asking which item I want and how many of them, until the item is "done".

If the item isn't one of those items, tell me it isn't on the list and ask again.

When the item is "done":
    Show the total.
    If the total is over $50, take 10% off and show the discounted total.
